travel time vs time difference (median |diff| s)             22.0             18.0
                                    DELAY events            13360            13940
                    DELAY events with delay <= 0                0                0
                                     event codes {'DELAY': 13360} {'DELAY': 13940}
'travel time' = time_between_stops of the arriving stop; 'time difference' = difference of recorded stop
times between consecutive stops (includes dwell at the previous stop).
Only delayed departures are written as DELAY events, so a mean departure delay over all trips cannot be
computed; Analysis B reports the number of DELAY events and their mean delay.
